ect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Business Productivity and Operational Efficiency<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34804e8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"34804e8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a2a24b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4a2a24b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>The implementation of an ERP system is essential to transform a company&#8217;s operation, increasing productivity and reducing costs. This system optimizes financial and logistical processes, improving operational efficiency.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li>Furthermore, it promotes better decision-making through the integration of various functional areas, maintaining a modular structure that facilitates adaptation.<br \/><br \/><\/li><li>ERP allows departments to act autonomously, empowering both SMEs and large companies to achieve objectives effectively and ensure sustainable growth.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d098ae0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d098ae0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&q